 "description": "Synapse (Matrix, namespace matrix, container synapse) on ClickHouse. Original upstream Synapse dashboard: every panel used synapse_* / python_* / process_* metrics from a Synapse /metrics scrape (job=synapse) that does not exist here \u2014 ClickHouse has zero synapse_* rows (7d) and Prometheus has zero synapse_* series (7d, checked 2026-10-13); the k8s otel collector has no synapse scrape job and the notifications-stack VM collector no longer hosts Synapse. 138 original panels (192 targets) therefore removed as dead. Replacement panels use only live ClickHouse data: kubeletstats container metrics for the synapse container and Synapse access logs in otel_logs (request rate / status / duration quantiles). If a synapse scrape is added later, restore the upstream panels ported to synapse_* in otel_metrics_*.",
